                "Literal": {
                  "Value": "'Weekly share of price observations on promotion. The Belgian government banned supermarket promotions for two weeks in March 2020 to curb panic buying; in the week of 23 March only 16 of 190,000 observations were promotions, all at Aldi. Aldi promotions are only recorded from February 2020.'"
